    "The job-file identity was preserved exactly: frozen campaign order 933, LCSC C485690, MPN AO7400, manufacturer Alpha Omega Semicon, family mosfet.",
    "The canonical PDF is AO7400, Rev 5: May 2011. All five PDF pages were examined.",
    "The electrical-characteristics table states Tj = 25 \u00b0C unless otherwise noted; the explicit 125 \u00b0C RDS(on) row and temperature-labelled curves retain their published temperatures.",
    "RDS(on) values published with less-than signs were recorded as maximum bounds with the corresponding maximum source_kind. Capacitances were retained in pF as published.",
    "The PDF provides body-diode characteristics as plots but no direct numeric body-diode voltage specification in the electrical-characteristics table; body_diode is therefore omitted rather than inferred. The plotted curves are retained under curves.",
    "Curve points are conservative digitizations of visible plotted grid locations only; no values were extrapolated beyond the displayed curves."
